# Developer Configuration for CnC Red Alert / Tiberian Dawn
# Copy to .env and uncomment desired settings.
#
# IMPORTANT: Settings are IGNORED in Release builds (CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release)
#
# Build version controls:
#   internal  - Full cheats, scenario editor
#   playtest  - Limited cheats (Alt+W to win)
#   release   - No cheats (default)

# BUILD_VERSION=internal

# Build language: english (default), german or french. Selects the
# compiled-in layout and strings; the game data supplies the rest.
# LANGUAGE=german
